### Upload a video
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

ur
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="sample.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample.mp4
------Boundary--
### Start transcription
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects/30ba1857-37b7-4f55-812d-821ba7de97f4/transcribe

### Check status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/30ba1857-37b7-4f55-812d-821ba7de97f4
### Export video
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects/30ba1857-37b7-4f55-812d-821ba7de97f4/export
Content-Type: application/json

{ "styleName": "yellow" }